                `Reduksi Primer: ${params.primDrive}T / ${params.primDriven}T | Final Gear: ${params.frontSprocket}T / ${params.rearSprocket}T`,
                `Rasio Gigi 1-6: 1(${params.gears[0].drive}/${params.gears[0].driven}) 2(${params.gears[1].drive}/${params.gears[1].driven}) 3(${params.gears[2].drive}/${params.gears[2].driven}) 4(${params.gears[3].drive}/${params.gears[3].driven}) 5(${params.gears[4].drive}/${params.gears[4].driven}) 6(${params.gears[5].drive}/${params.gears[5].driven})`,
